IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `cards-domain`
IMPORT `earn-kernel`
IMPORT `dbs-rewards`
IMPORT fixtures

§ `Terms and Conditions Governing the DBS Woman's Card Promotions and Programmes`

-- ===========================================================================
-- DOCUMENT. dbs-womans-card-tnc: "Terms and Conditions Governing the DBS
-- Woman's Card Promotions and Programmes", "Updated 27 Jul 2026" on every
-- page, cl.1-23 (DBS Bank Ltd). It governs two cards: the DBS Woman's World
-- Card (cl.15-19) and the DBS Woman's Card (cl.20-23). It is made under the DBS
-- Rewards Terms (dbs-rewards.l4), which it applies at cl.6 and incorporates at
-- cl.12.
--
-- WHAT THE TEXT SAYS.
--   cl.10      "DBS Points will be awarded based on the amount of eligible retail
--              transaction(s) charged, rounded down to the nearest number."
--   cl.11      "Online spend" = a retail transaction for goods and services "made
--              via the Internet and processed by the respective merchants/acquirers
--              as an online transaction through Mastercard Worldwide networks",
--              excluding (i) the MCCs of Table 1 (57 codes), (ii) the descriptions
--              of Table 2, (iii) payments made via online banking, (iv) payments
--              made via telephone or mail order, (v) posted 0% Interest IPP monthly
--              transactions, (vi) posted My Preferred Payment Plan monthly
--              transactions, (vii) interest, finance charges, cash advances, cash
--              withdrawal, balance transfer, smart cash, AXS payments, SAM online
--              bill payments, bill payments via internet banking and all fees
--              charged by DBS, and (viii) any other transactions DBS determines.
--   cl.12      "Overseas spend" = retail transactions "posted in foreign
--              currencies (other than Singapore dollars), excluding transactions
--              which are excluded from the awarding of DBS Points as set out in the
--              DBS Rewards Programme Terms and Conditions."
--   cl.13      "DBS determines an online transaction based on system indicators.
--              These indicators are decided by the merchant and their banker, and
--              passed to DBS when the transaction is posted to the Card."
--   cl.14      The transaction date is the merchant settlement date.
--   cl.16-19   Woman's World: Base 1X per S$5 on all spend (next working day);
--              Bonus Overseas additional 2X per S$5; Bonus Online additional 9X
--              (local) or 7X (overseas) per S$5, "capped at the first S$1,000 of
--              online spend per calendar month", "accumulated for the month and
--              awarded ... in the following calendar month", computed on "the
--              total transaction amount after accumulation for the calendar month
--              divided by S$5 and multiplied by 7 ... or 9 ..., rounded down".
--              Base and Overseas points: "the total transaction amount divided by
--              S$5 and multiplied by [1 or 2] ..., rounded down".
--   cl.21-23   Woman's Card: Base 1X per S$5; Bonus Online additional 4X, same cap
--              and accumulation.
-- DBS POINTS = 2 MILES (DBS Rewards T&C cl.10: 5,000 points = 10,000 miles).
-- Local online on the World card: 1X + 9X = 10 per S$5 = 4 miles per S$1.
-- Overseas online: 1X + 2X + 7X = 10 per S$5 = 4 miles per S$1.
-- Overseas, not online: 1X + 2X = 3 per S$5 = 1.2 miles per S$1.
--
-- THE FORKS.
--   F-womans-online-definition: "Online spend" is defined by the Internet and by
--     the merchant's indicator at once. A tap in a shop that the merchant's
--     acquirer flags online (a wallet tap in a shop) is
--     online by the indicator and not "made via the Internet". cl.13 says DBS
--     determines by the indicator, so the module lets the indicator decide
--     (Reading A); the stricter reading (both) is the one a cardholder's phone
--     call would put. The indicator not known is bracketed in any case.
--   F-womans-table-2: the Woman's Table 2 names about ninety counterparties,
--     chiefly cryptocurrency and foreign-exchange brokers; the module folds the
--     brokers into one constructor of the ontology.
-- ===========================================================================


§§ `cl.11 Table 1 -- Merchant Category Codes that are not Online spend`

-- Table 1: 0763 (read as 763), 4784, 4829, 4900, 5047, 5199, 5960, 5993, 6010,
-- 6011, 6012, 6051, 6050, 6211, 6300, 6381, 6399, 6513, 6529, 6530, 6534, 6540,
-- 7261, 7276, 7311, 7322, 7339, 7349, 7372, 7375, 7393, 7399, 7511, 7523, 7995,
-- 8062, 8111, 8211, 8220, 8241, 8244, 8249, 8299, 8398, 8651, 8661, 8699, 8911,
-- 8931, 8999, 9211, 9222, 9223, 9311, 9399, 9402, 9405.
GIVETH A LIST OF NUMBER
`the Woman's Table 1 category codes` MEANS
    LIST 763, 4784, 4829, 4900, 5047, 5199, 5960, 5993, 6010, 6011, 6012, 6051,
         6050, 6211, 6300, 6381, 6399, 6513, 6529, 6530, 6534, 6540, 7261, 7276,
         7311, 7322, 7339, 7349, 7372, 7375, 7393, 7399, 7511, 7523, 7995, 8062,
         8111, 8211, 8220, 8241, 8244, 8249, 8299, 8398, 8651, 8661, 8699, 8911,
         8931, 8999, 9211, 9222, 9223, 9311, 9399, 9402, 9405


§§ `cl.11 Table 2 and (iii)-(vii) -- what is not Online spend by description or kind`

-- Table 2 folded to counterparties: AMAZE, AXS, AXS BizPay, AXS PTE LTD, BAGUS,
-- CANTINE, CARDUP, EZLINK, EZ-LINK, FAVE ECARD, FAVEPAY, FLASHPAY ATU, IPAYMY,
-- MATCHMOVE PAY, MB MONEYBOOKERS.COM, OANDA, PAYPAL AXS PTE LTD, PAYPAL
-- BIZCONSULTA / CAPITALROYA / OANDAASIAPA, RAZERPAY, SAM, SAM PAYMENTS, SAXO CAP
-- MKTS PTS LTD, SEDAP, Sgebiz, SGeBiz, SHOPEEPAY, Singapore E-Business, SINGTEL
-- DASH, SKRSKRILL.COM, SmoovPay, SMOOV PTE LTD, TRANSIT, TRANSIT 3, WWW.IGMARKETS.COM.SG,
-- YOUTRIP and some seventy cryptocurrency and foreign-exchange names.
GIVEN d IS A Descriptor
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the Woman's Table 2 names the description` d MEANS
    CONSIDER d
    WHEN `Amaze`                                                   THEN TRUE
    WHEN `AXS`                                                     THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Bagus`                                                   THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Cantine`                                                 THEN TRUE
    WHEN `CardUp`                                                  THEN TRUE
    WHEN `EZ-Link`                                                 THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Fave or FavePay`                                         THEN TRUE
    WHEN `FlashPay`                                                THEN TRUE
    WHEN `iPayMy`                                                  THEN TRUE
    WHEN `MatchMove Pay`                                           THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Moneybookers`                                            THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Skrill`                                                  THEN TRUE
    WHEN `OANDA`                                                   THEN TRUE
    WHEN `PayPal AXS Pte Ltd`                                      THEN TRUE
    WHEN `PayPal Bizconsulta or Capitalroya or Oandaasiapa`        THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Razerpay`                                                THEN TRUE
    WHEN `SAM`                                                     THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Saxo`                                                    THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Sedap`                                                   THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Sgebiz`                                                  THEN TRUE
    WHEN `ShopeePay`                                               THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Singapore E-Business`                                    THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Singtel Dash`                                            THEN TRUE
    WHEN `SmoovPay`                                                THEN TRUE
    WHEN `TRANSIT`                                                 THEN TRUE
    WHEN `IG Markets`                                              THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Youtrip`                                                 THEN TRUE
    WHEN `A cryptocurrency or forex counterparty in DBS Table 2`   THEN TRUE
    OTHERWISE                                                           FALSE

-- cl.11(iii)-(vii) by kind of charge and by presentation.
GIVEN k IS A `Charge kind`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the Woman's cl.11 excludes the kind` k MEANS
    CONSIDER k
    WHEN `Retail purchase`                                   THEN FALSE
    WHEN `Bill payment`                                      THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Bill paid directly to the biller on the card`      THEN FALSE
    WHEN `Top-up of a prepaid card or stored-value account`  THEN FALSE
    WHEN `Payment of funds to a payment service provider`    THEN FALSE
    WHEN `Instalment plan charge`                            THEN TRUE
    WHEN `My Preferred Payment Plan charge`                  THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Cash advance`                                      THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Balance transfer or funds transfer`                THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Fee, interest or finance charge`                   THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Pre-authorisation`                                 THEN FALSE
    WHEN `Payment through UOB Payment Facility`              THEN FALSE
    WHEN `NETS or NETS-related transaction`                  THEN FALSE
    WHEN `SmartPay or personal loan`                         THEN FALSE
    WHEN `Transit-related transaction`                       THEN FALSE

-- cl.11(iv): telephone or mail order is not Online spend.
GIVEN how IS A Presentation
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the Woman's cl.11 excludes the presentation` how MEANS
    how EQUALS `Card details given by telephone or mail order`

GIVEN p IS A Purchase
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the purchase is excluded from Online spend by the Woman's terms` p MEANS
    `the code is among` p `the Woman's Table 1 category codes`
    OR `the Woman's Table 2 names the description` (p's descriptor)
    OR `the Woman's cl.11 excludes the kind` (p's `charge kind`)
    OR `the Woman's cl.11 excludes the presentation` (p's presentation)
    OR p's `later reversed`


§§ `cl.16-19, cl.21-23 -- the points`

GIVETH A NUMBER
`the Woman's online spend cap per calendar month in S$` MEANS 1000

-- The bonus multiple (DBS Points per S$5) on Online spend, by card and currency.
GIVEN c IS A Card
      overseas IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the Woman's Online bonus DBS Points per S$5 on` c `when overseas is` overseas MEANS
    IF c EQUALS `DBS Woman's World Mastercard`
    THEN IF overseas THEN 7 ELSE 9
    ELSE 4

-- The Overseas bonus (World card only), per S$5.
GIVEN c IS A Card
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the Woman's Overseas bonus DBS Points per S$5 on` c MEANS
    IF c EQUALS `DBS Woman's World Mastercard` THEN 2 ELSE 0

-- The part of this purchase that falls inside the first S$1,000 of the month's
-- accumulated online spend.
GIVEN amount IS A NUMBER
      accumulated IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the online dollars of a purchase of` amount `inside the cap after` accumulated MEANS
    min amount (`at least nothing` (`the Woman's online spend cap per calendar month in S$` MINUS accumulated))

-- cl.19(d): rounded down on the month's accumulated total; a purchase's share
-- is the rise in the rounded total.
GIVEN amount IS A NUMBER
      accumulated IS A NUMBER
      multiple IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the Woman's Online bonus DBS Points on` amount `after` accumulated `at` multiple MEANS
    (FLOOR (((min accumulated (`the Woman's online spend cap per calendar month in S$`)) PLUS (`the online dollars of a purchase of` amount `inside the cap after` accumulated)) DIVIDED BY 5 TIMES multiple))
    MINUS (FLOOR ((min accumulated (`the Woman's online spend cap per calendar month in S$`)) DIVIDED BY 5 TIMES multiple))

GIVEN amount IS A NUMBER
      accumulated IS A NUMBER
      multiple IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the Woman's Online bonus DBS Points wanted for` amount `after` accumulated `at` multiple MEANS
    (FLOOR ((amount DIVIDED BY 5) TIMES multiple))


§§ `The answer when the code and indicator are settled`

GIVEN c IS A Card
      p IS A Purchase
      m IS A `Woman's month`
GIVETH AN `Earn answer`
`Woman's answer when the facts are settled` c p m MEANS
    IF `DBS Rewards cl.2.8 excludes the purchase` p
    THEN `nothing is earned on` c `in` `DBS Points` `per` "DBS Rewards T&C cl.2.8 (applied by the Woman's terms cl.6, cl.12)"
    ELSE `Woman's answer on a purchase DBS Rewards allows` c p m

GIVEN c IS A Card
      p IS A Purchase
      m IS A `Woman's month`
GIVETH AN `Earn answer`
`Woman's answer on a purchase DBS Rewards allows` c p m MEANS
    `an answer for` c `in` `DBS Points` `of` (`the Woman's DBS Points on` c p m) `to` (`the Woman's DBS Points on` c p m) `wanting` (`the Woman's bonus DBS Points wanted on` c p m) `at` (JUST `miles per DBS Point`) `excluded` FALSE `drawing on` (`the Woman's pot of` c p) `depending on` EMPTY `per` "DBS Woman's Card T&C cl.16-19, cl.21-23; DBS Rewards T&C cl.10"

-- Online spend by the terms' own test: the indicator flags it and no exclusion applies.
GIVEN p IS A Purchase
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the purchase is Online spend` p MEANS
    p's `merchant indicator` EQUALS `Flags online`
    AND NOT (`the purchase is excluded from Online spend by the Woman's terms` p)

GIVEN c IS A Card
      p IS A Purchase
GIVETH A Pot
`the Woman's pot of` c p MEANS
    IF `the purchase is Online spend` p THEN `Woman's online` ELSE `No pot`

GIVEN c IS A Card
      p IS A Purchase
      m IS A `Woman's month`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the Woman's DBS Points on` c p m MEANS
    (`the Base DBS Points on a purchase of` (p's `amount in SGD`))
    PLUS (IF `the purchase is overseas spend` p
          THEN FLOOR (((p's `amount in SGD`) DIVIDED BY 5) TIMES (`the Woman's Overseas bonus DBS Points per S$5 on` c))
          ELSE 0)
    PLUS (IF `the purchase is Online spend` p
          THEN `the Woman's Online bonus DBS Points on` (p's `amount in SGD`) `after` (m's `online spend accumulated`) `at` (`the Woman's Online bonus DBS Points per S$5 on` c `when overseas is` (`the purchase is overseas spend` p))
          ELSE 0)

GIVEN c IS A Card
      p IS A Purchase
      m IS A `Woman's month`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the Woman's bonus DBS Points wanted on` c p m MEANS
    (IF `the purchase is overseas spend` p
     THEN FLOOR (((p's `amount in SGD`) DIVIDED BY 5) TIMES (`the Woman's Overseas bonus DBS Points per S$5 on` c))
     ELSE 0)
    PLUS (IF `the purchase is Online spend` p
          THEN `the Woman's Online bonus DBS Points wanted for` (p's `amount in SGD`) `after` (m's `online spend accumulated`) `at` (`the Woman's Online bonus DBS Points per S$5 on` c `when overseas is` (`the purchase is overseas spend` p))
          ELSE 0)

-- The indicator she cannot see: bracket the card-present reading against the online one.
GIVEN c IS A Card
      p IS A Purchase
      m IS A `Woman's month`
GIVETH AN `Earn answer`
`Woman's answer when the indicator flags card-present` c p m MEANS
    `Woman's answer when the facts are settled` c (`reflagged purchase` p `Flags card-present`) m

GIVEN c IS A Card
      p IS A Purchase
      m IS A `Woman's month`
GIVETH AN `Earn answer`
`Woman's answer when the indicator flags online` c p m MEANS
    `Woman's answer when the facts are settled` c (`reflagged purchase` p `Flags online`) m

GIVEN c IS A Card
      p IS A Purchase
      m IS A `Woman's month`
GIVETH AN `Earn answer`
`Woman's answer when the code is settled` c p m MEANS
    IF p's `merchant indicator` EQUALS `Indicator not known`
    THEN `bracketed from` (`Woman's answer when the indicator flags card-present` c p m) `to` (`Woman's answer when the indicator flags online` c p m) `adding` (LIST `The merchant's indicator is not known`)
    ELSE `Woman's answer when the facts are settled` c p m

`a Woman's code that is excluded` MEANS 4829
`a Woman's code that earns` MEANS 5399

GIVEN c IS A Card
      p IS A Purchase
      m IS A `Woman's month`
GIVETH AN `Earn answer`
`DBS Woman's card earns on` c p m MEANS
    IF `the code is unknown for` p
    THEN `bracketed from` (`Woman's answer when the code is settled` c (`recoded purchase` p `a Woman's code that is excluded`) m) `to` (`Woman's answer when the code is settled` c (`recoded purchase` p `a Woman's code that earns`) m) `adding` (LIST `The merchant category code is not known`)
    ELSE `Woman's answer when the code is settled` c p m


§§ `The clock the Woman's online pot runs on`

-- cl.19(b)-(c) and cl.14.
GIVETH A `Period basis`
`the Woman's online pot's period` MEANS `Calendar month`

GIVETH A `Date basis`
`the Woman's online pot's date basis` MEANS `Transaction date`

#ASSERT `the Woman's online pot's period` EQUALS `Calendar month`
#ASSERT `the Woman's online pot's date basis` EQUALS `Transaction date`


§§ `Illustrations`

GIVEN accumulated IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `Woman's month`
`a Woman's month with online spend of` accumulated MEANS
    `Woman's month` WITH `online spend accumulated` IS accumulated

`a fresh Woman's month` MEANS `a Woman's month with online spend of` 0
`the World card` MEANS `DBS Woman's World Mastercard`
`the Woman's Card` MEANS `DBS Woman's Card`

`S$100 online in Singapore dollars, flagged online` MEANS `reflagged purchase` (`purchase paid by` `the base purchase` `Card number entered online`) `Flags online`
`S$100 online in Singapore dollars, indicator not known` MEANS `reflagged purchase` `S$100 online in Singapore dollars, flagged online` `Indicator not known`
`S$100 online in Singapore dollars, flagged card-present` MEANS `reflagged purchase` `S$100 online in Singapore dollars, flagged online` `Flags card-present`
`S$100 online in US dollars, flagged online` MEANS `purchase in currency` `S$100 online in Singapore dollars, flagged online` `Another foreign currency`
`S$100 overseas in person in US dollars` MEANS `purchase in currency` (`purchase at location` `the base purchase` `A store outside Singapore`) `Another foreign currency`
`S$100 in store in Singapore dollars` MEANS `the base purchase`

-- cl.16: Base 1X + Bonus Online 9X = 10 DBS Points per S$5: S$100 -> 200 DBS Points = 400 miles = 4 mpd.
#ASSERT (`DBS Woman's card earns on` `the World card` `S$100 online in Singapore dollars, flagged online` `a fresh Woman's month`)'s `units certain` EQUALS 200
#ASSERT fromMaybe 0 ((`DBS Woman's card earns on` `the World card` `S$100 online in Singapore dollars, flagged online` `a fresh Woman's month`)'s `miles certain`) EQUALS 400
-- ... overseas online: 1 + 2 + 7 = 10 per S$5: 200.
#ASSERT (`DBS Woman's card earns on` `the World card` `S$100 online in US dollars, flagged online` `a fresh Woman's month`)'s `units certain` EQUALS 200
-- ... overseas in person (not online): 1 + 2 = 3 per S$5: 60 = 120 miles = 1.2 mpd.
#ASSERT (`DBS Woman's card earns on` `the World card` `S$100 overseas in person in US dollars` `a fresh Woman's month`)'s `units certain` EQUALS 60
#ASSERT fromMaybe 0 ((`DBS Woman's card earns on` `the World card` `S$100 overseas in person in US dollars` `a fresh Woman's month`)'s `miles certain`) EQUALS 120
-- ... in store in Singapore dollars, flagged card-present: Base only, 20 DBS Points = 40 miles = 0.4 mpd.
#ASSERT (`DBS Woman's card earns on` `the World card` `S$100 in store in Singapore dollars` `a fresh Woman's month`)'s `units certain` EQUALS 20
-- ... online but flagged card-present by the acquirer: Base only.
#ASSERT (`DBS Woman's card earns on` `the World card` `S$100 online in Singapore dollars, flagged card-present` `a fresh Woman's month`)'s `units certain` EQUALS 20
-- ... a tap in store that the acquirer flags online is Online spend by the indicator (Reading A).
#ASSERT (`DBS Woman's card earns on` `the World card` (`reflagged purchase` `S$100 in store in Singapore dollars` `Flags online`) `a fresh Woman's month`)'s `units certain` EQUALS 200
-- ... indicator not known: floor 20, ceiling 200.
#ASSERT (`DBS Woman's card earns on` `the World card` `S$100 online in Singapore dollars, indicator not known` `a fresh Woman's month`)'s `units certain` EQUALS 20
#ASSERT (`DBS Woman's card earns on` `the World card` `S$100 online in Singapore dollars, indicator not known` `a fresh Woman's month`)'s `units at best` EQUALS 200
#ASSERT elem `The merchant's indicator is not known` ((`DBS Woman's card earns on` `the World card` `S$100 online in Singapore dollars, indicator not known` `a fresh Woman's month`)'s `depends on`)

-- cl.21: the Woman's Card: 1X + 4X = 5 per S$5: S$100 -> 100 DBS Points = 200 miles = 2 mpd.
#ASSERT (`DBS Woman's card earns on` `the Woman's Card` `S$100 online in Singapore dollars, flagged online` `a fresh Woman's month`)'s `units certain` EQUALS 100
-- ... and no overseas bonus on the Woman's Card: overseas in person earns the Base only, 20.
#ASSERT (`DBS Woman's card earns on` `the Woman's Card` `S$100 overseas in person in US dollars` `a fresh Woman's month`)'s `units certain` EQUALS 20

-- cl.19(b): the first S$1,000 of online spend per calendar month. With S$950 accumulated, S$100 has S$50 inside the cap:
-- Base 20 + online bonus: floor(1000/5 x 9) - floor(950/5 x 9) = 1800 - 1710 = 90 -> 110.
#ASSERT (`DBS Woman's card earns on` `the World card` `S$100 online in Singapore dollars, flagged online` (`a Woman's month with online spend of` 950))'s `units certain` EQUALS 110
-- ... with S$1,000 accumulated, the Base only: 20.
#ASSERT (`DBS Woman's card earns on` `the World card` `S$100 online in Singapore dollars, flagged online` (`a Woman's month with online spend of` 1000))'s `units certain` EQUALS 20
-- ... the bonus wanted before the cap is floor(100/5 x 9) = 180.
#ASSERT (`DBS Woman's card earns on` `the World card` `S$100 online in Singapore dollars, flagged online` (`a Woman's month with online spend of` 1000))'s `bonus units before cap` EQUALS 180
#ASSERT (`DBS Woman's card earns on` `the World card` `S$100 online in Singapore dollars, flagged online` `a fresh Woman's month`)'s pot EQUALS `Woman's online`

-- cl.17(b), cl.19(d): arithmetic, rounded down. S$4.99 online earns floor(0.998) = 0 Base and floor(8.982) = 8 Bonus = 8;
-- S$9.99 earns floor(1.998)=1 Base and floor(17.982)=17 Bonus = 18.
#ASSERT (`DBS Woman's card earns on` `the World card` (`purchase for` `S$100 online in Singapore dollars, flagged online` 4.99) `a fresh Woman's month`)'s `units certain` EQUALS 8
#ASSERT (`DBS Woman's card earns on` `the World card` (`purchase for` `S$100 online in Singapore dollars, flagged online` 9.99) `a fresh Woman's month`)'s `units certain` EQUALS 18
-- ... the Base below S$5 is 0.
#ASSERT (`DBS Woman's card earns on` `the World card` (`purchase for` `S$100 in store in Singapore dollars` 4.99) `a fresh Woman's month`)'s `units certain` EQUALS 0

-- cl.11 Table 1: online at MCC 7399 (Business Services) is not Online spend; the Base DBS Point still applies (not on the Rewards Table 1).
#ASSERT (`DBS Woman's card earns on` `the World card` (`recoded purchase` `S$100 online in Singapore dollars, flagged online` 7399) `a fresh Woman's month`)'s `units certain` EQUALS 20
-- ... MCC 4829 is on both tables: nothing at all.
#ASSERT (`DBS Woman's card earns on` `the World card` (`recoded purchase` `S$100 online in Singapore dollars, flagged online` 4829) `a fresh Woman's month`)'s excluded
-- ... MCC 0763 (763) is on the Woman's Table 1 only.
#ASSERT (`DBS Woman's card earns on` `the World card` (`recoded purchase` `S$100 online in Singapore dollars, flagged online` 763) `a fresh Woman's month`)'s `units certain` EQUALS 20
-- ... an online purchase at a shop (5399) earns the bonus.
#ASSERT (`DBS Woman's card earns on` `the World card` (`recoded purchase` `S$100 online in Singapore dollars, flagged online` 5399) `a fresh Woman's month`)'s `units certain` EQUALS 200
-- ... airfares and OTAs have no MCC exclusion here: travel (3001, 4722) online earns the bonus.
#ASSERT (`DBS Woman's card earns on` `the World card` (`recoded purchase` `S$100 online in Singapore dollars, flagged online` 3001) `a fresh Woman's month`)'s `units certain` EQUALS 200
#ASSERT (`DBS Woman's card earns on` `the World card` (`recoded purchase` `S$100 online in Singapore dollars, flagged online` 4722) `a fresh Woman's month`)'s `units certain` EQUALS 200

-- cl.11 Table 2 and cl.2.8: ShopeePay is on both; CardUp is on the Woman's Table 2 only (Base still earned).
#ASSERT (`DBS Woman's card earns on` `the World card` (`purchase described as` `S$100 online in Singapore dollars, flagged online` `ShopeePay`) `a fresh Woman's month`)'s excluded
#ASSERT (`DBS Woman's card earns on` `the World card` (`purchase described as` `S$100 online in Singapore dollars, flagged online` `CardUp`) `a fresh Woman's month`)'s `units certain` EQUALS 20
#ASSERT (`DBS Woman's card earns on` `the World card` (`purchase described as` `S$100 online in Singapore dollars, flagged online` `A cryptocurrency or forex counterparty in DBS Table 2`) `a fresh Woman's month`)'s `units certain` EQUALS 20
-- cl.11(iv): telephone or mail order is not Online spend.
#ASSERT (`DBS Woman's card earns on` `the World card` (`purchase paid by` `S$100 online in Singapore dollars, flagged online` `Card details given by telephone or mail order`) `a fresh Woman's month`)'s `units certain` EQUALS 20
-- cl.11(iii),(vii): a payment via internet banking is not Online spend and earns nothing; an instalment plan earns nothing.
#ASSERT (`DBS Woman's card earns on` `the World card` (`purchase of kind` `S$100 online in Singapore dollars, flagged online` `Bill payment`) `a fresh Woman's month`)'s excluded
#ASSERT (`DBS Woman's card earns on` `the World card` (`purchase of kind` `S$100 online in Singapore dollars, flagged online` `Instalment plan charge`) `a fresh Woman's month`)'s excluded
-- A bill paid directly on the card is not named: it earns as Online spend.
#ASSERT (`DBS Woman's card earns on` `the World card` (`purchase of kind` `S$100 online in Singapore dollars, flagged online` `Bill paid directly to the biller on the card`) `a fresh Woman's month`)'s `units certain` EQUALS 200
-- A reversed charge earns nothing.
#ASSERT (`DBS Woman's card earns on` `the World card` (`purchase later reversed` `S$100 online in Singapore dollars, flagged online`) `a fresh Woman's month`)'s excluded

